# Mansion de Neon, top floor (C4a, contract 39), 10 x 8, interior. column = i, row = j. A sunny study at the top of the stairs (door cell (8,3), back down to 1F). The owner (`mama`) cannot keep her pet Mimbara
# she asks whether you will take it and gives it at level 25 (`give mimbara 25`; flag 77 = given; a full party keeps the flag clear: come back with room).
@map mansion_neon_2
@size 10 8
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn stairs 8 4 N
@flag mimbara_given 77
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  object=bookshelf text=mansion.top.books interact=look
  f  object=bookshelf text=mansion.top.books2 interact=look
  g  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  h  object=escalator
  i  object=table
  j  door=escalator
  k  npc=mama id=owner face=W script=owner
  l  object=flowerbed
@grid
  abbcbbcbbb
  def.......
  g.......h.
  d...i...j.
  g....k....
  dl........
  d.....l...
  d.........
@warp j -> mansion_neon spawn=stairs
# The owner: she cannot keep Mimbara; whoever takes it gets it at level 25 (once, flag 77). A full party: she asks you to come back with room (the flag stays clear).
@script owner npc
    npc_face_hero owner
    jf mimbara_given after
    say mansion.owner.hi
    say mansion.owner.story
    ask mansion.owner.ask
    jv 0 1 yes
    say mansion.owner.no
    end
  yes:
    give mimbara 25
    jv 0 1 got
    say mansion.owner.full
    end
  got:
    setf mimbara_given
    say mansion.owner.given
    say mansion.owner.hint
    end
  after:
    say mansion.owner.after
@end
